<includeonly><onlyinclude><div class="template-collapsible mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="{{{1|Expand}}}" data-collapsetext="{{{2|Collapse}}}"></onlyinclude></includeonly>
For usage, type the following in Source Editor:
<pre>{{Collapsible}}
Text
</div></pre>

To customise the Expand/Collapse message use:
<pre>{{Collapsible|Open|Close}}
Text
</div></pre>

